  "slug": "beatles-painting-images-of-a-woman-sells-auction-155250",
  "title": "14 September 2012: Beatles painting Images Of A Woman sells for $155,250",
  "date": "2012-09-14",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>The only known painting by all four members of The Beatles has sold at auction for $155,250. <span id=\"more-13737\"></span></p><p>The oil and watercolour artwork was created by The Beatles in June and July 1966, while on tour in Tokyo. Tight security measures meant they were unable to leave their suite at the Hilton hotel for three nights, so they collaborated on a painting which became known as ‘Images Of A Woman’.</p><p>Each Beatle painted parts of the 30″x40″ paper, working by the light of a lamp in the centre. When the painting was complete the lamp was removed, and The Beatles signed the empty space next to their contributions.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-12402\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1ODAiIGhlaWdodD0iMzkyIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNTgwIDM5MiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"12402\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1083\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles’ painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01-960x650.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_01-580x392.jpg\" alt=\"The Beatles’ painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" width=\"580\" height=\"392\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-12402\"></a></p><p>The paper and paints were provided by the Japanese promoter, Tats Nagashima, who suggested that the completed painting be auctioned for charity. It was subsequently bought by a cinema manager and local fan club president Tetsusaburo Shimoyama.</p><p>‘Images Of A Woman’ is believed to be the only instance of a painting by all four Beatles. It was sold again in Osaka for ¥15 million, and in 2002 appeared on the eBay auction website.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2012/09/14/beatles-painting-images-of-a-woman-sells-auction-155250/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-13737 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTQyIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE0MiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"142\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-200x142.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-200x142.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-580x411.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-960x680.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-768x544.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-1536x1089.jpg 1536w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02.jpg 1600w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"12403\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1600,1134\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_02-960x680.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"157\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-200x157.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-200x157.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-580x455.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-960x753.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03-768x602.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03.jpg 1194w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"12404\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1966-photos/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_japan_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1194,936\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles painting Images Of A Woman, Tokyo, 1966\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/images-of-a-woman_1966_j